{"seq":1,"slug":"climate-change-basics","title":"气候变化基础","stage":"DONE","category":"climate-energy-transition","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/climate-change-basics","rating":{"composite":3.77,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.2,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 气候变化基础\n\n## 概述\n\n气候变化是当代人类面临的最重大全球性挑战之一。本 Hub 从物理科学基础出发，系统梳理气候变化的核心机制、温室气体排放现状、未来影响预测以及国际政策框架，为理解能源转型与碳中和路径提供科学基础。\n\n## 章节结构\n\n本 Hub 包含 4 个章节、12 篇文档：\n\n### 第一章：气候科学基础\n\n从地球能量收支平衡、碳循环机制到气候系统反馈，建立对气候系统运行的物理认知。\n\n### 第二章：温室气体机制\n\n深入分析 CO₂、CH₄、N₂O 等主要温室气体的排放源、浓度变化趋势及监测技术体系。\n\n### 第三章：影响与预测\n\n基于 IPCC AR6 评估报告，解读 SSP 情景路径、物理影响与社会经济影响。\n\n### 第四章：政策框架\n\n覆盖巴黎协定、中国双碳战略、碳定价机制等全球气候治理核心制度安排。\n\n## 学习路径\n\n建议按章节顺序阅读：先掌握物理机制（第一、二章），再理解影响预测（第三章），最后进入政策框架（第四章）。\n\n## 前置知识\n\n- 基础物理学概念（能量、辐射、热力学）\n- 基础化学概念（碳、氧循环）\n- 对全球环境议题的基本关注\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"climate-science","title":"气候科学基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/climate-change-basics/climate-science","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"earth-energy-balance","title":"地球能量收支","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/climate-change-basics/climate-science/earth-energy-balance"},{"seq":2,"slug":"carbon-cycle","title":"碳循环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/climate-change-basics/climate-science/carbon-cycle"},{"seq":3,"slug":"climate-system-feedbacks","title":"气候系统反馈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/climate-change-basics/climate-science/climate-system-feedbacks"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"greenhouse-mechanism","title":"温室气体机制","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/climate-change-basics/greenhouse-mechanism","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"co2-emissions","title":"CO₂排放与浓度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/climate-change-basics/greenhouse-mechanism/co2-emis